  <identification>
    <creator type="composer">Traditional (South Appalachian folk song)</creator>
    <creator type="lyricist">Olive A. Wadsworth, 1870</creator>
    <creator type="arranger">PianoFlow teaching setting</creator>
    <rights>Melody and first-verse text are in the public domain. The left-hand accompaniment is an original PianoFlow teaching setting.</rights>
    <encoding>
      <software>PianoFlow / A+Piano</software>
      <encoding-date>2026-11-26</encoding-date>
    </encoding>
    <source>Common classroom / South Appalachian folk tune, verified against Feierabend 2021 solfege (The Book of Children's Songtales, GIA, pp. 40-41, via the Epstein/Rappaport analysis) and the PianoLessons4Children C-major melody sheet. See song.json for sources and variants. Left-hand part is not taken from those arrangements.</source>
  </identification>
